# Care Pathway Front-End — environment example.
# Copy to `.env` (`cp .env.example .env`) and adjust per deployment.
#
# Both vars are read server-side only (BFF model; see
# agents/share/authentication-sessions.md) — never bundled to the
# browser. See `src/lib/server/config.ts`.

# Base URL of the care-pathway service REST API, used by the same-origin
# `/api/proxy` BFF route (loco.rs dev default :5150).
CARE_PATHWAY_API_URL=http://localhost:5150

# Base URL of the central authentication service, used by the BFF for
# the magic-link login flow and the session→PASETO exchange.
AUTH_API_URL=http://localhost:5150

# Opt-in "Sign in with SSO" link on /signin (OIDC / Keycloak, EV-2;
# agents/share/authentication-sessions.md §7a). PUBLIC_-prefixed on purpose:
# the sign-in page reads it in the browser to decide whether to show the
# link. Set this ONLY when the paired auth-service deployment has its own
# AUTH_OIDC_* variables configured; unset (the default) hides the link
# entirely, and magic link stays the default sign-in path.
# PUBLIC_OIDC_SIGNIN_ENABLED=true
